{"path":"/documentation/modeling/mixins/loadable","section":"documentation","title":"loadable","description":"Documentation for the nnsight Python library","toc":[{"id":"nnsight.modeling.mixins.loadable","label":"loadable","depth":2},{"id":"nnsight.modeling.mixins.loadable.Loadable","label":"Loadable","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight.modeling.mixins.loadable.split_envoy_kwargs","label":"split_envoy_kwargs","depth":3}],"segments":[{"type":"html","html":"<h2 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.loadable\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-module\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-module-name\">loadable</span>\n\n\n</h2>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.loadable.Loadable\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-class\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-class-name\">Loadable</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"Loadable(*args: Any, **kwargs: Any)"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n            <p class=\"doc-class-bases\">\n              Bases: <code><a title=\"            Envoy (nnsight.intervention.envoy.Envoy)\" href=\"/documentation/intervention/envoy#nnsight.intervention.envoy.Envoy\">Envoy</a></code></p>\n\n\n\n        <p>An <a title=\"            Envoy\" href=\"/documentation/intervention/envoy#nnsight.intervention.envoy.Envoy\"><code>Envoy</code></a> that loads its own module.</p>\n<p>The constructor accepts either a ready <code>torch.nn.Module</code> or load\narguments (e.g. a repo id) and dispatches accordingly: a ready module goes\nto <code>_wrap</code> (base: build the tree over it as-is), anything else to <code>_load</code>\n(build the module from the arguments). Subclasses override whichever paths\nthey support; an override never receives the other path's argument kind.</p>\n<p>Keyword arguments split by <code>split_envoy_kwargs</code>: Envoy's parameters go to\n<code>Envoy.__init__</code>, the rest to the load path.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"doc-children\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight.modeling.mixins.loadable.split_envoy_kwargs\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">split_envoy_kwargs</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"split_envoy_kwargs(kwargs: dict) -> tuple[dict, dict]"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Split <code>kwargs</code> into <code>(envoy_kwargs, load_kwargs)</code>.</p>\n<p>Envoy's own parameters (<code>interleaver</code>, <code>rename</code>, ...) route to\n<code>Envoy.__init__</code>; everything else is a load argument for\n<code>Loadable._load</code>.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"}]}